
# Distributed Data Platform

An open-source engineering project demonstrating
scalable data processing, cloud-native infrastructure,
AI diagnostics, and cost optimization.

## Technology Stack

- Scala / Apache Spark — Distributed processing
- Go — Cloud-native ingestion
- Python — AI and ML diagnostics
- React / TypeScript — Platform dashboard
- Apache Iceberg — Lakehouse storage
- AWS / Kubernetes — Cloud infrastructure

## Core Modules

1. Metadata-driven data processing
2. Distributed ingestion and orchestration
3. Spark performance and reliability
4. AI-powered diagnostics
5. Cloud cost intelligence and FinOps
6. Platform monitoring dashboard

## Engineering Goals

- Correctness and fault tolerance
- Scalability and performance
- Observability
- Cost efficiency
- Reproducible benchmarks
- Automated testing

## Status

Project initialization in progress.

## Development

Modules will be implemented incrementally.
All example data will be synthetic.
